# Board patch paths, one per line in application order.
#
# The OS profile series is deliberately not listed in board.toml: its
# zzz-boot-progress.patch has hunks against sheng_pmgr_run() and
# sheng_boot_watchdog_policy(), which only the SM8550 SoC patches provide. The
# board copy below keeps every other checkpoint of that patch.
#
# Keep the XnuPrelink patches here because dropping the OS series drops them too.
zzz-boot-progress.patch
component:XnuPrelink/patches/xnu-10063.141.1-security-init.patch
component:XnuPrelink/patches/xnu-10063.141.1-sparse-index.patch
# Host-toolchain workaround, not a behaviour change: osfmk/ipc/mach_port.c
# asserts on a const local, which is not an integer constant expression in C.
# Xcode 15's clang folds it, Xcode 14's does not. See scripts/xnu-clang for the
# other two arguments this host has to rewrite.
zzzz-host-clang-static-assert.patch
# Same class, same reason: libkern/os/log.c asserts that two macro aliases have
# the same address, which Xcode 14's clang will not fold into a constant.
zzzz-host-clang-xnupost-assert.patch
